NAME
    gcloud alpha run instances logs - read logs for Cloud Run instances

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha run instances logs COMMAND [--region=REGION]
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Read logs for Cloud Run instances.

FLAGS
     --region=REGION
        Region in which the resource can be found. Alternatively, set the
        property [run/region].

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     read
        (ALPHA) Read logs for a Cloud Run instance.

     tail
        (ALPHA) Tail logs for a Cloud Run instance.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

